Third-party components in ALICE-Space
=====================================

python-sgp4 (https://github.com/brandon-rhodes/python-sgp4, commit
8126f773923c2902719d45aab8bdb5cce86cf39d)

- src/sgp4.rs follows the structure and operation order of python-sgp4's
  sgp4/propagation.py (a translation of David Vallado's sgp4unit, AIAA
  2006-6753).
- tests/data/sgp4/SGP4-VER.TLE and tests/data/sgp4/tcppver.out are copied
  unchanged from python-sgp4 (Vallado's verification element sets and the
  output of his C++ reference).

